  "prefLabel": "Nat 501.01 Applicability",
  "priorExpiration": "2004-11-26",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Nat 501.01 Applicability. This part shall apply to the prescribing of opioids for the treatment of non-cancer and non-terminal pain, and shall not apply to the supervised administration of opioids in a health care setting.\n\nSource. #6380, eff 11-26-96, EXPIRED: 11-26-04\n\nNew. #12113, eff 2-22-17",
